WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.624 --> 00:00:09.505
Each dossier receives the expenses of its type. Open the right one.

2
00:00:09.505 --> 00:00:14.019
Click “Add” to enter an expense.

3
00:00:14.019 --> 00:00:23.485
Describe the expense: what was paid, when and where.

4
00:00:23.485 --> 00:00:28.703
Enter the amount, in the country's currency.

5
00:00:28.703 --> 00:00:35.495
Choose the manager in charge: without one, the dossier cannot be submitted.

6
00:00:35.495 --> 00:00:46.888
Click “Save”. The line stays a draft, still editable, until it is submitted.
